{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0001-s001", "text": "Det är lätt att hitta annonser om hyresbostäder på internet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0001-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.331146240234375, "generation_seconds": 15.53124196198769, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0001-s002", "text": "Bostäder hyrs ut av bostadsbolag, som ägs av städer och kommuner samt olika företag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0001-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.732244897959184, "peak": 0.26739501953125, "generation_seconds": 20.560066487872973, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0001-s003", "text": "Även privata hyresvärdar söker hyresgäster.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0001-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.249251700680272, "peak": 0.2716064453125, "generation_seconds": 12.068780103931203, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0001-s004", "text": "Privata hyresvärdar är människor som äger bostäder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0001-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.9458503401360545, "peak": 0.261260986328125, "generation_seconds": 17.31642712908797, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0002-s001", "text": "Hyresbostäderna i ett bostadsbolag som ägs av en stad eller en kommun är i allmänhet billigare än bostäder som ägs av en privatperson eller ett företag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0002-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.374693877551021, "peak": 0.460205078125, "generation_seconds": 38.39971953397617, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0002-s002", "text": "Det kan ändå finnas många sökande till stadens eller kommunens bostäder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0002-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.238555908203125, "generation_seconds": 22.559395264135674, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0002-s003", "text": "Man kan göra en bostadsansökan på internet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0002-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.179591836734694, "peak": 0.255615234375, "generation_seconds": 12.9917692609597, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0003-s001", "text": "Vanligtvis ingår hyresgästen ett hyresavtal direkt med bostadens ägare, det vill säga ett företag, en privat hyresvärd eller ett kommunalt bostadsbolag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0003-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.956734693877552, "peak": 0.30859375, "generation_seconds": 35.5808389801532, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0003-s002", "text": "Hen är då bostadens huvudhyresgäst.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0003-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.3436734693877552, "peak": 0.25872802734375, "generation_seconds": 11.868698997888714, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0003-s003", "text": "Ibland kan huvudhyresgästen låta en underhyresgäst flytta in i bostaden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0003-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.199727891156463, "peak": 0.28143310546875, "generation_seconds": 22.48038116004318, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0003-s004", "text": "Då får en annan person bo i till exempel ett av rummen i samma bostad som huvudhyresgästen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0003-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.238861083984375, "generation_seconds": 25.14796435413882, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0003-s005", "text": "Underhyresgästen ingår ett skriftligt hyresavtal med huvudhyresgästen, inte med bostadens ägare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0003-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.289215087890625, "generation_seconds": 23.971259888028726, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0004-s001", "text": "Huvudhyresgästen ansvarar för bostaden och betalningen av hyran.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0004-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.28643798828125, "generation_seconds": 18.835391105152667, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0004-s002", "text": "Om huvudhyresgästen inte själv bor i bostaden, utan hyr ut hela bostaden till någon annan, är det fråga om vidareuthyrning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0004-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.727619047619047, "peak": 0.30865478515625, "generation_seconds": 28.362032026983798, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0004-s003", "text": "Uthyraren, eller hyresvärden, ska alltid informeras om vidareuthyrning och hen kan av grundad anledning också förbjuda vidareuthyrning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0004-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.563537414965987, "peak": 0.314361572265625, "generation_seconds": 39.83368927589618, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0005-s001", "text": "Ägarboende betyder för det mesta att den boende äger antingen ett egnahemshus eller en bostadsaktie.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0005-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.397552490234375, "generation_seconds": 25.539628135971725, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0005-s002", "text": "När man äger ett egnahemshus är man själv ansvarig för alla reparationer, skatter och andra avgifter som är förknippade med huset och att bo i det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0005-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.747755102040816, "peak": 0.474578857421875, "generation_seconds": 32.71229478600435, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0006-s001", "text": "Om man äger en bostad i ett höghus eller ett radhus är det fråga om en bostadsaktie.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0006-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.453605442176871, "peak": 0.3682861328125, "generation_seconds": 21.641927274875343, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0006-s002", "text": "I sådana fall äger personen inte själva bostaden, utan aktier i det husbolag som förvaltar huset.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0006-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.70748299319728, "peak": 0.392730712890625, "generation_seconds": 16.7974805010017, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0006-s003", "text": "I husbolaget bestämmer aktieägarna tillsammans om vilka renoveringar som ska göras i huset och om underhållet av det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0006-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.3304443359375, "generation_seconds": 23.928839424159378, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0006-s004", "text": "Dessutom betalar aktieägarna varje månad ett vederlag till husbolaget som täcker bland annat uppvärmningen av bostaden, avfallshanteringen och servicebolagets tjänster.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0006-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.419591836734694, "peak": 0.45660400390625, "generation_seconds": 37.940290183061734, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0007-s001", "text": "Tomten som ett hus står på kan ägas av husets ägare eller av bostadsaktiebolaget.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0007-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.292205810546875, "generation_seconds": 25.268067717086524, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0007-s002", "text": "Tomten kan också vara en arrendetomt, som ägs av till exempel kommunen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0007-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.478367346938776, "peak": 0.31341552734375, "generation_seconds": 19.71967518609017, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0007-s003", "text": "De boende i ett hus som ägs av ett bostadsaktiebolag på en arrendetomt betalar hyra för tomten som en del av vederlaget.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0007-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.279571533203125, "generation_seconds": 34.27283439016901, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0008-s001", "text": "En bostadsrättsbostad är en bostad för vilken du först betalar en bostadsrättsavgift.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0008-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.801904761904762, "peak": 0.24658203125, "generation_seconds": 22.063505027908832, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0008-s002", "text": "Dessutom betalar du varje månad en viss summa för boendet, ett bruksvederlag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0008-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.757006802721088, "peak": 0.32391357421875, "generation_seconds": 26.778410200960934, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0008-s003", "text": "Bostadsrättsavgiften är cirka 15 procent av bostadens pris.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0008-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.339047619047619, "peak": 0.297882080078125, "generation_seconds": 25.106421230826527, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0008-s004", "text": "Bruksvederlagets storlek beror på bostaden och orten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0008-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.27838134765625, "generation_seconds": 24.571125861024484, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0009-s001", "text": "Om bostadsrättsbostaden inte är byggd med statligt stöd kan husets ägare själv välja de boende.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0009-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.777142857142858, "peak": 0.24713134765625, "generation_seconds": 32.37070957198739, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0009-s002", "text": "Om staten har betalat understöd för byggandet av bostaden, finns det olika kriterier som tillämpas på de boende, till exempel ålder och förmögenhet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0009-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.678095238095239, "peak": 0.26123046875, "generation_seconds": 51.84609877713956, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0010-s001", "text": "Med delägarbostad avses en bostad där du först köper endast en del av bostaden och hyr sedan bostaden som du bor i.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0010-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.170340136054422, "peak": 0.2833251953125, "generation_seconds": 36.34914282592945, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0010-s002", "text": "Senare kan du köpa bostaden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0010-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.9257142857142857, "peak": 0.304595947265625, "generation_seconds": 11.005299001000822, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0011-s001", "text": "När du flyttar in i en delägarbostad, betalar du först ungefär 10–20 procent av bostadens pris.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0011-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.195102040816327, "peak": 0.247039794921875, "generation_seconds": 34.20028710993938, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0011-s002", "text": "Därefter hyr du bostaden som du bor i.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0011-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4829931972789114, "peak": 0.28851318359375, "generation_seconds": 14.144489742117003, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0011-s003", "text": "Hyrestiden är vanligtvis kring 5–12 år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0011-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.73687074829932, "peak": 0.228424072265625, "generation_seconds": 15.270411476958543, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0011-s004", "text": "Du kan samtidigt köpa fler andelar av bostaden, om du har kommit överens om detta med byggherren.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0011-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.428843537414966, "peak": 0.31781005859375, "generation_seconds": 27.065455226926133, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0012-s001", "text": "Efter hyrestiden köper du bostaden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0012-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.274013605442177, "peak": 0.310943603515625, "generation_seconds": 10.058155588107184, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0012-s002", "text": "Då äger du en vanlig ägarbostad i ett bostadsaktiebolag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0012-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.231109619140625, "generation_seconds": 17.765144139993936, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0013-s001", "text": "Om du är studerande kan du söka hyresbostäder som är speciellt avsedda för studerande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0013-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.257965087890625, "generation_seconds": 27.641701174899936, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0013-s002", "text": "Studentbostäder har ofta lägre hyra än vanliga bostäder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0013-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.295379638671875, "generation_seconds": 20.321037114830688, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0014-s001", "text": "Studentbostäder hyrs ut av studentbostadsstiftelser, universitetens studentkårer, nationer och vissa andra stiftelser.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0014-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.797278911564625, "peak": 0.32110595703125, "generation_seconds": 40.4860957688652, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0014-s002", "text": "Dessutom har vissa läroanstalter egna studenthem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0014-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.527891156462585, "peak": 0.297943115234375, "generation_seconds": 20.6177082399372, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0014-s003", "text": "Fråga på din studieort var du kan söka en studentbostad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0014-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.28192138671875, "generation_seconds": 19.737463886849582, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0015-s001", "text": "Om du får en studentbostad kan du vanligen bo i den under hela studietiden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0015-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.28192138671875, "generation_seconds": 24.1847258110065, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0015-s002", "text": "Du måste dock studera på heltid och framskrida i dina studier.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0015-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.29669189453125, "generation_seconds": 22.341076847864315, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0015-s003", "text": "Hyresvärden kan säga upp hyresavtalet om du inte klarar tillräckligt många kurser.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0015-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.453605442176871, "peak": 0.25347900390625, "generation_seconds": 29.602678352035582, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0016-s001", "text": "I Finland ordnas stödboende (tukiasuminen) och serviceboende (palveluasuminen) för dem som behöver stöd för att kunna bo självständigt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0016-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.981496598639456, "peak": 0.39288330078125, "generation_seconds": 42.68143009603955, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0017-s001", "text": "Stöd- och serviceboende kan ordnas för", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0017-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.900952380952381, "peak": 0.321502685546875, "generation_seconds": 14.703881714958698, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
