{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0022-s001", "text": "människor som återhämtar sig från problem med den mentala hälsan och missbrukarproblem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0022-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.592925170068027, "peak": 0.28948974609375, "generation_seconds": 23.59141497896053, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0023-s001", "text": "Stöd- och serviceboende tillhandahålls av välfärdsområdena, organisationer och privata företagare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0023-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.195102040816327, "peak": 0.299713134765625, "generation_seconds": 24.999885431025177, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0024-s001", "text": "Den som bor i en stödbostad klarar nästan självständigt av de dagliga bestyren.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0024-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.2880859375, "generation_seconds": 21.52567999321036, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0024-s002", "text": "Stödets omfattning beror på den boendes behov.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0024-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.249251700680272, "peak": 0.323699951171875, "generation_seconds": 12.653240620158613, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0024-s003", "text": "En stödbostad kan antingen vara kundens egen ägarbostad, en hyresbostad eller någon annan bostadsform.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0024-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.916462585034013, "peak": 0.28985595703125, "generation_seconds": 23.493347090901807, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0025-s001", "text": "Hur länge man bor i stödbostad beror på kundens livssituation och behov.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0025-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.339047619047619, "peak": 0.27471923828125, "generation_seconds": 16.228683181107044, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0025-s002", "text": "Avsikten är att kunderna under sin tid i en stödbostad kommer till rätta med sitt liv i den mån att de kan övergå till självständigt boende.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeformer/narration/hb-c11-u0025-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.842176870748299, "peak": 0.29669189453125, "generation_seconds": 42.320115860784426, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
